{"id": "t094-006", "text": "Nikhil doesn't drink at all, but he loves a really good ginger beer. Fentimans if we can find it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikhil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ginger beer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Fentimans", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t094-007", "text": "Phoebe's grandmother died last week. The funeral is sometime early next month in Cork, and Phoebe is flying over with her brother Thomas. Don't forget to ask her when exactly so I can send flowers.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Phoebe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime early next month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Phoebe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her when exactly", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t094-014", "text": "Bogdan and Zara are hosting a housewarming at the end of the month. Zara said not to bring wine because Bogdan has given up alcohol for the year. Bring sparkling elderflower instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "given up alcohol", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the year"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Bring sparkling elderflower", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t094-018", "text": "Haruto has started a keto diet. No rice, no bread, lots of eggs. He's been doing it since early September and swears by it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "keto diet", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "No rice, no bread", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since early September"}]}
{"id": "t094-019", "text": "Mei and Thabo are expecting their first baby in April 2027. Mei can't eat soft cheese or sushi at the moment, which she says is killing her. Thabo is already panicking about the nursery, and his mum keeps sending him links to cots. Her scan is on 12 November 2026, and they're telling their families properly after that. Mei said she mostly craves salt and vinegar crisps and cold orange juice.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't eat soft cheese or sushi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking about the nursery", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "12 November 2026", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after that"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "salt and vinegar crisps", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cold orange juice", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t094-021", "text": "Angela said her brother Felix is getting divorced. His wife moved out a couple of weeks ago. Angela is worried about him because he's not eating properly and won't talk about it. Their parents don't know yet, and he wants to tell them himself when he visits at the end of the month. She asked if I'd keep an eye on him at five a side.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Felix", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting divorced", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a couple of weeks ago", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not eating properly", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visits", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t094-022", "text": "Note to self: Milan prefers tea to coffee, builder's tea, milk and two sugars.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "prefers tea to coffee", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "builder's tea, milk and two sugars", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t094-023", "text": "Divya's band has a gig on 6 December 2026 at the Lexington. She's playing keyboard and is nervous because it's their first headline show. Don't forget to text her good luck on the day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 December 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "keyboard", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t094-032", "text": "Spent the morning with Uncle Thomas. He's started cooking for himself since Auntie passed away, mostly soups. He's quite proud of his leek and potato. He's still struggling on Sundays, which was always their day for a roast. His neighbour has started dropping round, which helps. I want to have him over for lunch one Sunday in November, and I should ask whether he still can't eat onions.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Thomas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cooking for himself", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Auntie"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite proud of his leek and potato", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sundays"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "neighbour", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "have him over for lunch", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "one Sunday in November", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask whether he still can't eat onions", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't eat onions", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t094-033", "text": "Simone's partner Jasmine got made redundant last week. Simone says she's taking it badly and spending all day on job sites. I need to send Simone a message to see how they're both doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jasmine", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "taking it badly", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Simone a message to see how they're both doing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t094-036", "text": "Elena's mum passed away on 3 October 2026 after a long illness. Elena has gone back to Spain for a few weeks to help her dad sort things out. She said they're both okay but it's a lot. She's back sometime around mid November. I'd like to get something for when she's back, maybe her favourite Turkish delight, and make sure the team doesn't overwhelm her on her first day. Remind me to ask Kemal when exactly she lands.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 October 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gone back to Spain", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a lot", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime around mid November", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "when she's back", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Turkish delight", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "make sure the team doesn't overwhelm her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Kemal when exactly she lands", "owner": "p3", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t094-038", "text": "Long chat with Matilda's mum, Angela, at pickup. Matilda is struggling since her best friend moved away over the summer. Angela is thinking of signing her up to swimming to help her make new friends.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "best friend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t094-039", "text": "The Popescus' anniversary dinner was called off because Bogdan's mum had a fall. She's in hospital with a broken wrist, but they think she'll be home by the end of the week. Zara said they'll rebook the restaurant for sometime in early December instead. Bogdan is driving up to see his mum on Saturday and staying until Tuesday. Remind me to ask him how she's doing when he's back.", "spans": [{"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "broken wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in early December"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "until Tuesday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how she's doing", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "when he's back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t094-041", "text": "Groceries: oat milk, gluten free pasta, lemons, coriander, bin bags.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "oat milk, gluten free pasta, lemons, coriander, bin bags", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t094-042", "text": "Jin's dog Rolo had an operation on his leg on Monday. Jin is taking him back to the vet on 30 October 2026 to get the stitches out. Rolo is apparently sulking in the cone.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rolo", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking him back to the vet", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "30 October 2026", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t094-043", "text": "Coffee with Zara. Her ex, Milan, has moved in with someone new, only three months after they split up. She's trying not to care but obviously does. Her sister told her to delete his number. She said she's going to take a break from dating until the new year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "ex", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved in with someone new", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "only three months after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying not to care", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "take a break from dating", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the new year"}]}
{"id": "t094-044", "text": "Felix said his mum makes the best pierogi. He's going home to Kraków over Christmas and she'll be making them for Wigilia.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Felix", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "makes the best pierogi", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going home to Kraków", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wigilia"}]}
{"id": "t094-046", "text": "Aiko and her boyfriend Louis are vegetarian, but they both eat fish occasionally. He's the fussier one; no olives, no capers.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Louis", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "eat fish occasionally", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "no olives, no capers", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t094-049", "text": "Divya's grandmother turns ninety on 15 February 2027. The whole family is going to a restaurant in Leicester. Divya says she's a fussy eater and only really likes plain food, so finding a place has been a nightmare. Her cousin wanted somewhere fancy, but her aunt vetoed it. They've settled on a small Gujarati place that her grandmother has been going to since the seventies.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns ninety", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 February 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to a restaurant in Leicester", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fussy eater", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "likes plain food", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "small Gujarati place", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the seventies"}]}
{"id": "t094-051", "text": "Nikhil, or Nik as everyone calls him, is moving to Manchester at the end of the year for a new job. His girlfriend is staying in London for now, and they're going to try long distance.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikhil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nik", "same_as": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Manchester", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "staying in London", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "try long distance", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}]}
{"id": "t094-055", "text": "Rebecca said Zoe's ex has been messaging her again, which Zoe hasn't mentioned to me. Zoe's flat sale is supposed to complete at the end of the month, and then she moves in with Ebony until she finds somewhere. Ebony doesn't seem thrilled, because her own boyfriend has only just moved in. Rebecca thinks Zoe should talk to someone about the breakup. I shouldn't bring up the messages, but I could invite her round for dinner sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rebecca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "ex", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flat sale", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moves in", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until she finds somewhere", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't seem thrilled", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p5"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved in", "owner": "p5", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rebecca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite her round for dinner", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t094-056", "text": "Kemal's sister Aaliyah is getting married on 12 June 2027 in Istanbul. Kemal says the menu is a nightmare because half the guests are vegetarian and the groom's side are all big meat eaters.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aaliyah", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12 June 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "groom", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t094-058", "text": "Spoke to Thomas after his redundancy meeting this afternoon. They've offered him a package and he has until the end of next week to decide. He's leaning towards taking it and going freelance. His partner Louis is supportive but a bit nervous about money, especially with the wedding planned for over the summer. Thomas sounded calmer than I expected. I should ring him on Monday to see what he's decided.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the end of next week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "decide", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Louis", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "supportive", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous about money", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "calmer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t094-059", "text": "Matilda Lewis from next door said her husband's memorial service is on 21 November 2026. She'd like people to bring a dish instead of flowers. I'm making my lentil soup, which she always liked.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda Lewis", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "memorial service", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "21 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "lentil soup", "owner": "p1"}]}
